#: src/ui/settings/user/Connections.tsx
msgid "We give Twitch your channel id so it tells us when you go live or offline; people who can see your profile then see that you are live. We read your name again once a day and keep nothing from Twitch older than 24 hours. We keep no Twitch sign-in."
msgstr "我们会把你的频道 ID 提供给 Twitch，由它在你开播或下播时通知我们；能看到你个人资料的人随后会看到你正在直播。我们每天重新读取一次你的名称，不保留任何超过 24 小时的 Twitch 数据。我们不保存 Twitch 登录信息。"

#: src/ui/settings/user/Connections.tsx
msgid "We have updated what you agree to when you link Battle.net: it now names where your data goes. You agree to it the next time you confirm on Battle.net."
msgstr "我们更新了你关联 Battle.net 时所同意的内容：现在会说明你的数据去向。你将在下次于 Battle.net 确认时表示同意。"

#: src/ui/settings/user/Connections.tsx
msgid "We have updated what you agree to when you link GitHub: it now names where your data goes. Until you agree, your GitHub account does not show on your profile and Refresh stays off."
msgstr "我们更新了你关联 GitHub 时所同意的内容：现在会说明你的数据去向。在你同意之前，你的 GitHub 账号不会显示在个人资料中，刷新也保持关闭。"

#: src/ui/settings/user/Connections.tsx
msgid "We have updated what you agree to when you link Steam: it now covers game pictures and up to 60 of your latest achievements with the day you unlocked them (no time of day), and it names where your data goes. Until you agree, Refresh stays off and nothing new shows."
msgstr "我们更新了你关联 Steam 时所同意的内容：现在包括游戏图片以及最多 60 个你最新的成就和解锁日期（不含具体时间），并会说明你的数据去向。在你同意之前，刷新保持关闭，也不会显示任何新内容。"

#: src/ui/settings/user/Connections.tsx
msgid "We have updated what you agree to when you link Twitch: it now names where your data goes. Until you agree, your channel does not show on your profile and we exchange no data with Twitch about it."
msgstr "我们更新了你关联 Twitch 时所同意的内容：现在会说明你的数据去向。在你同意之前，你的频道不会显示在个人资料中，我们也不会就此与 Twitch 交换任何数据。"

